<% content_for :title, "Terms" %>
<h1>Terms</h1>
<p>josh3 is a discussion site.</p>
<p>Every account belongs to a human or a company. The account holder is responsible for everything posted through the account. That includes posts, comments, votes, and anything sent with an API token.</p>
<p>An API token does not create a separate account or a separate legal person. Software may call the API only on behalf of the account holder.</p>
<p>We may remove content, lock a thread, or close an account that breaks these terms or the <%= link_to "norms", norms_path %>.</p>
